[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"d08_ration_card"
title = "Ration rotation"
byline = "index card, pencil, taped inside the store room door"
hand = 1
body = "14 DAY CYCLE — ONE

DAY 1   BISCUIT 3   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 2   BISCUIT 3   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 3   BISCUIT 3   SUPP —   WATER 2 QT
DAY 4   BISCUIT 3   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 5   BISCUIT 2   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 6   BISCUIT 3   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 7   BISCUIT 3   SUPP —   WATER 2 QT

DAY 8   BISCUIT 3   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 9   BISCUIT 3   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 10  BISCUIT 3   SUPP —   WATER 2 QT
DAY 11  BISCUIT 3   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 12  BISCUIT 2   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 13  BISCUIT 3   SUPP 1   WATER 2 QT
DAY 14  BISCUIT 3   SUPP —   WATER 2 QT

ROTATE FRONT TO BACK. OLDEST FORWARD.
CARTONS 1962 STOCK STILL GOOD, TESTED.

CYCLE BEGAN   02 MAR 98
NEXT ROTATION 16 MAR 98"
